{"articleNo":"109014","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=109014&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"'2014 권역별 국제문화교류 전문가 양성사업' 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.07.10","hit":"2457","attachments":[{"name":"지원서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=109014&attachNo=72961"},{"name":"[공고문] 2014 국제문화교류 예비인력 파견사업 공모.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=109014&attachNo=73052"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">문화체육관광부는 재단법인 예술경영지원센터를 사업시행주체로 하여 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">해외문화원 인턴사업</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을 추진함으로써 대학생들에게 해외 한국문화원에서 인턴으로 활동할 수 있는 기회를 제공해오고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">올해도 국내 대학생들을 대상으로 해외 한국문화원에 파견</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">ㆍ</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">배치될 인턴을 공개 모집하오니, 신청자격 요건에 부합하는 관심있는 학생들은, <strong><u><font color=\"#0900ff\">7</font><font color=\"#0900ff\">월 16일(수) 15시까지 구비서류들을 국제교류교육원으로 제출</font></u></strong>하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp;신청자를 자체 심사하여&nbsp;최대 3명을 추천하여, 예술경영지원센터로 발송할 예정입니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">보다 자세한 사항은 재단법인 예술경영지원센터 인력개발팀 김승연 과장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(02-708-2266 / yeonkim@gokams.or.kr) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">또는 임수빈 사원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(02-708-2271 / subin@gokams.or.kr) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">에게 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
